5^2 = 25 \equiv 6 \pmod{19}
\]
\[
12^3 = 12 \cdot 12 \cdot 12 = 144 \cdot 12 \equiv 7 \cdot 12 = 84 \equiv 84 - 4 \cdot 19 = 84 - 76 = 8 \pmod{19}
\]
Thus, \[
5^2 \cdot 12^3 \equiv 6 \cdot 8 = 48 \equiv 48 - 2 \cdot 19 = 48 - 38 = 10 \pmod{19}
\]
